menu "embpet io"

    config EMBPET_IO_TEST
        bool "On-chip GPIO test hooks (never enable in production)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles in test-only code: the outputs become INPUT_OUTPUT and an
            any-edge ISR timestamps their edges (`io test`), so the pulse
            length can be measured on the chip itself. Used by
            tools/io_test.py.

    config EMBPET_LED_TEST
        bool "On-chip status LED test hooks (never enable in production)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles in test-only code: the LED pin becomes INPUT_OUTPUT and an
            any-edge ISR timestamps its edges (`led t_edges`), so the pattern
            can be measured on the chip. Used by tools/led_test.py.

endmenu
